meta {
  name: Approve Booking Request
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/booking-requests/{{bookingRequestId}}/approve
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {}
}

docs {
  Creates the appointment in one transaction: the email's active patient (reactivated if inactive,
  otherwise untouched), else a new PORTAL patient from the typed details; the consent with the
  request's original time and evidence; a CONFIRMED appointment with an email reminder. The patient
  gets the confirmation (for a virtual location once the Meet link is ready).

  `{ "restorePatientId": "<uuid>" }` restores one of the request's deleted candidates instead (409
  while an active patient holds the email). 409 "Booking request is no longer pending" for a resolved
  or expired request; a slot conflict is also 409 and leaves the request PENDING. Cookie requests
  need `X-CSRF-Token`.
}
